### 1. Checkout (Ganti Payment Method ke QRIS)
POST http://localhost:3000/pos/checkout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nomor_whatsapp": "628123456789",
  "cashier_id": "KASIR-01",
  "payment_method": "QRIS",
  "items": [
    {
      "paket_id": "PAKET-REGULER",
      "harga": 20000,
      "qty": 2
    }
  ]
}

### 2. Generate QRIS Code (Gunakan pos_trx_id dari Step 1)
POST http://localhost:3000/pos/qris/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pos_trx_id": "a7b1c8bb-d52d-42c9-b69a-05769d6ec944",
  "amount": 40000
}

### 3. Simulasi Webhook Pembayaran Lunas (Simulasi dari QRIS Simulator)
POST http://localhost:3000/pos/webhook/payment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pos_trx_id": "a7b1c8bb-d52d-42c9-b69a-05769d6ec944",
  "transaction_status": "settlement"
}